{"id":"644435","name":"辣肉蔬菜丁炒饭","author":"蓝雨阳光780913","authorId":"11379263","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/644435/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"冷饭","amount":"100g"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"}],"sub":[{"name":"莴笋","amount":"100g"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"100g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"莴笋去掉皮切成丁。","img":"images/644435/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"胡萝卜切成丁备用。","img":"images/644435/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"腊肉切成丁。","img":"images/644435/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"油热以后，打入鸡蛋搅散炒香。","img":"images/644435/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入辣肉丁和蔬菜丁。","img":"images/644435/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"将鸡蛋块和蔬菜，肉丁翻炒均匀。","img":"images/644435/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入冷饭翻炒。","img":"images/644435/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"把冷饭和各种配菜翻炒均匀。","img":"images/644435/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加入盐调味。","img":"images/644435/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"出锅。","img":"images/644435/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}